<h2 id="the-bottom-line-quality-epub-matters-for-childrens-books">The Bottom Line: Quality EPUB Matters for Children's Books</h2>
<p>The children's ebook market in 2026 is growing but increasingly crowded. The flood of low-effort AI-generated children's books has raised the bar for what readers and parents expect. A professionally formatted fixed-layout EPUB is not just a technical requirement — it is a signal of quality that sets your book apart from automated productions.</p>
<p>The workflow is well established: design at the right dimensions in InDesign (or Affinity), export as fixed-layout EPUB, validate with EPUBCheck, test on at least two real devices, and submit to Apple Books, Kobo, and Google Play. For Amazon, convert to KFX via Kindle Create as an additional step.</p>
